,"status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"引古諫太子舅氏官屬，現有羊祜書引古；原生前宜核疏廣故事平行，非今太子臣。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0273","start":273,"end":275,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"72m_dhb_tf7","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"疏廣不獨親外家為太子官屬的故事，與漢書071宣帝/許氏及009宣帝太子即孝元相接；首選後來漢元帝，非最近晉太子；晉概括與漢對上奏語非逐字同引。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:u0276","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"start":276,"end":278,"surface":"舅氏","status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"疏廣典故親屬類稱，未讀原典不補許氏名"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0319","start":319,"end":322,"surface":"馮野王","kind":"person","person_id":"1mu_6ja_3mp","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"漢世不用馮野王，registry未見全名；不造其父母妻或合馮奉世。"}],"source_position":{"raw_start":4207,"raw_end":4545,"raw_character_offsets":[4207,4208,4209,4210,4211,4212,4213,4214,4215,4216,4217,4218,4219,4220,4221,4222,4223,4224,4225,4226,4227,4228,4229,4230,4231,4232,4233,4234,4235,4236,4237,4238,4239,4240,4241,4242,4243,4244,4245,4246,4247,4248,4249,4250,4251,4252,4253,4254,4255,4256,4257,4258,4259,4260,4261,4262,4263,4264,4265,4266,4267,4268,4269,4270,4271,4272,4273,4274,4275,4276,4277,4278,4279,4280,4281,4282,4283,4284,4285,4286,4287,4288,4289,4290,4291,4292,4293,4294,4295,4296,4297,4298,4299,4300,4301,4302,4303,4304,4305,4306,4307,4308,4309,4310,4311,4312,4313,4314,4315,4316,4317,4318,4319,4320,4321,4322,4323,4324,4325,4326,4327,4328,4329,4330,4331,4332,4333,4334,4335,4336,4337,4338,4339,4340,4341,4342,4343,4344,4345,4346,4347,4348,4349,4350,4351,4352,4353,4354,4355,4356,4357,4358,4359,4360,4361,4362,4363,4364,4365,4366,4367,4368,4369,4370,4371,4372,4373,4374,4375,4376,4377,4378,4379,4380,4381,4382,4383,4384,4385,4386,4387,4388,4389,4390,4391,4392,4393,4394,4395,4396,4397,4398,4399,4400,4401,4402,4403,4404,4405,4406,4407,4408,4409,4410,4411,4412,4413,4414,4415,4416,4417,4418,4419,4420,4421,4422,4423,4424,4425,4426,4427,4428,4429,4430,4431,4432,4433,4434,4435,4436,4437,4438,4439,4440,4441,4442,4443,4444,4445,4446,44